WEBVTT

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:50.300
I want to ride a train...

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:54.790
A train departs.
The smoke remains behind.

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:57.570
The smoke left behind
is the reason for a complaint.

00:00:57.910 --> 00:00:58.900
Miyu-chan...

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:01.120
Do you have
any complaints?

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:02.230
I don't like it here.

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:04.300
I want to go somewhere else.

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:06.380
What are you going to do
with your mother?

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:09.480
My mother doesn't
care about me.

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:12.310
Sometimes she doesn't
even remember my name.

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:14.110
A mother's voice
calls to her child...

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:15.590
...does not reach the child.

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:19.120
Your mother is weeping
in her heart.

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:20.330
I don't know.

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:23.220
Well, Mr. Kijutsushi...

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:25.700
Could you take me
away with you?

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:27.130
That's not a bad idea.

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:29.470
We're not kidnappers.

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:30.940
We are simply traveling.

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:34.670
Is that so?
That's disappointing.

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:36.500
I need to go home now.

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:38.110
Rape blossoms...

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:40.870
...the moon to the east
and the sun to the west.

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:43.380
Oops. I got
the season wrong.

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:45.780
Come visit us at the shack.

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:48.280
All right.
Good-bye, you two.

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:51.180
We can't leave her
behind again.

00:01:52.530 --> 00:01:55.590
The moon is full
and what will be born is...

00:01:57.370 --> 00:01:58.760
...a demon.

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:28.650
Abirah-Oohn-Ken-Sowa-Kah.
Abirah-Oohn-Ken-Sowa-Kah.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:36.540
Moon, be shattered!

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:39.760
Turn the night of this world
completely dark!

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:48.620
Or...I WILL DO SO!

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:14.740
That traveling theater company
came to our village again.

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:16.570
- A theater company?
- Remember?

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:20.010
That gentleman magician
and the young guy with a student hat?

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:21.910
They are playing here
again this year.

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:23.210
This year, too?

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:25.580
Miyu, how old are you now?

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:28.550
Come on, I will be 14
the day after tomorrow.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:31.530
What am I gonna do?
What am I gonna do?

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:33.960
Mother! Calm down!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.590
- Miyu.
- What?

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:38.920
Don't go near birds.

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:41.760
Birds? You mean
swallows and crows?

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:43.200
That's right.

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:44.600
They'll poke your eyes.

00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:46.260
Then...

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:50.170
Ah, your father is coming home.

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:51.330
I need to get
a bath ready for him.

00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:54.500
Mother, my father died.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:59.010
Your father will surely take
a bath no matter how late it gets.

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:00.290
He always does.

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:05.460
I'll take care of it.
Go ahead and eat your dinner.

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:14.930
I wonder why my father died.

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:20.070
I wonder if...

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:23.970
...Mother will get better if I take her
to see a doctor in town.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:44.600
Excuse me.

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:49.330
Are you done?

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:50.740
Uh...yes.

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:52.930
Wow, you worked extra hard.

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:55.940
Lady, you are
very good at crafts.

00:04:57.050 --> 00:04:59.040
One, two, three.

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:00.410
Here they are.

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:02.580
Thank you very much.

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:06.120
Hey, young girl,
you've grown.

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:08.900
You're too old to be
juggling bean bags.

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:12.120
Why don't you
come with to town?

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.490
I'll buy you
a new kimono.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.590
Would you like
a red silk one? Huh?

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:19.360
I don't want a red kimono.

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:22.210
Don't be so hostile.

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:24.380
Ouch!

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:28.170
Don't you like me?

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:30.200
My father is coming home.

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:34.910
Young lady, you don't know
how your father died, do you?

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:37.020
Do you know?

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:39.610
He was eaten by birds.

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:42.210
He was poked by birds
and there wasn't even a bone left.

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:44.290
Ahhhhh!

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:47.420
Leave! Leave right away!

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:50.360
Mother!
Mother, calm down!

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:57.170
I'll come again.

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:09.120
WORLD'S BEST MAGIC SHOW

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:19.790
Ms. Miyu,
it's been a while...

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.540
Hi, Uncle, are you well?

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.450
Yes, as you see.

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:30.240
Uncle.

00:06:32.470 --> 00:06:35.140
How would you like
to be my assistant?

00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:37.880
Would I put doves
in a basket or something?

00:06:38.110 --> 00:06:39.580
Birds are not good. Um...

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.840
Ms. Miyu,
you get into the box.

00:06:42.180 --> 00:06:45.080
Then, a while later,
I'll pierce the box with a sword.

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:47.210
Won't it hurt?

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:51.080
However, mysteriously,
you don't even get a scratch!

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:53.320
Anyway, why don't you
hang out for a while?

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:58.120
Reiha, why don't you greet her?

00:06:58.770 --> 00:06:59.930
How do you do?

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:02.330
Hello.

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:04.540
Is her mother a member
of the company, too?

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:06.700
My mother passed away.

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:09.030
Is that so?
Must be hard.

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:12.350
Well, everyone
looks after her.

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:15.080
She'll become a star
of the company soon.

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:16.680
She's still a kid.

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:20.820
Miyu, wouldn't you like
to be in the next play?

00:07:21.090 --> 00:07:22.060
Really?

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:26.360
I, the magician with no equal,
have never told a lie.

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:27.870
It's true.

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:29.160
What kind of play?

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:33.090
Probably...the famous Kabuki
Ashiya Doh-man Oh-uchi Kagami.

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:36.930
It has music, dancing,
and you name it. It's fun.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:38.730
I'd like to dance.

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:41.030
Then let's start
practicing right away.

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:43.780
Reiha, stay quiet, all right?

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:50.510
Father doesn't
play with me at all.

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:52.750
This doll is too boring.

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:15.230
Madam, would you
please let us take Miyu?

00:08:16.110 --> 00:08:17.080
Miyu?

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:21.440
Yes, she is my daughter.

00:08:22.050 --> 00:08:23.450
It's almost time
for the harvest moon.

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:26.350
The birds are coming.

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:28.980
Miyu!

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:30.550
Where did Miyu go?

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:32.420
Don't worry.

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:36.360
As long as we are here,
we won't let anyone touch her.

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:38.100
Back then...

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:41.190
...you saved me
holding Baby Miyu.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:43.830
Who are you?

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:48.810
We are kakashi ( scarecrows ).
Dolls to scare birds away.

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:52.740
Why am I here?

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:56.150
Because you
are her mother.

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.480
Tonight the Guardian will wake up.

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:30.710
If she wakes
up completely...

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:33.350
...even we wouldn't be able
to defeat her so easily.

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:37.320
We'll aim at the moment
she hatches out of the egg.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:40.760
No questions, right?

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.790
Good. Now go!

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:57.900
The Moon to the East
and the Sun to the West.

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:23.130
Mommy, Mommy...

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:26.630
Who is calling so loud?

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:28.610
Oh, Honorable priest.

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:32.270
My name is Yasuna Abe.

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:36.190
We've come looking
for this child's mother.

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:38.810
Then, what's the mother's name?

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:40.280
It's Kuzu-no-ha.

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:41.690
What?

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:43.590
Did you say Kuzu-no-ha?

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:46.690
Do you have any idea
where she might be?

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:48.070
No.

00:10:48.130 --> 00:10:50.890
But you seem to have details
you want to share with me.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:52.130
Yes.

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:56.670
Kuzu-no-ha vanished,
leaving this child behind.

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:59.670
She left a song behind, too.

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:04.640
"If you miss me,
come visit me.

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:08.550
A resentful Kudzu leaf
in Shinoda Forest in Izumi."

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:12.250
We used this song
as a clue and came here.

00:11:12.590 --> 00:11:14.320
Mommy, Mommy.

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:16.990
This is indeed
Shinoda Forest.

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:21.560
Kuzu-no-ha is here,
but I can't let you see her.

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:23.560
Why?

00:11:24.430 --> 00:11:26.090
As you must
already know...

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:28.470
...Kuzu-no-ha is not human.

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:31.400
Once she
reveals her real self...

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:34.040
...she cannot return
to the human world.

00:11:34.680 --> 00:11:36.610
That's so cruel.

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:40.080
Why wouldn't a mother
care about her child?

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:43.290
Let us see her
even for a second.

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:45.240
Mommy, Mommy.

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:46.690
That voice...

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:48.010
...it's my daughter.

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:50.620
No. You can't come out!

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:52.390
No, Honorable priest...

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:55.560
...I can't stand it!

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:59.070
Even if I end up
in the tortuous Mugen Hell...

00:11:59.430 --> 00:12:03.030
...I want to hold my child
in my arms one last time.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:05.200
We beg of you.

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:06.660
I see.

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:10.040
The love between a parent
and child cannot be cut off.

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:11.510
Do whatever you like.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:14.450
But if you do
meet for one last time...

00:12:14.780 --> 00:12:16.910
...you are destined
to forget your child's face...

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:19.650
...and wander
around through hell.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:21.090
That's...

00:12:25.460 --> 00:12:26.720
So, what do you say?

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:28.230
Well, it's...

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:30.020
Now, what do you say?

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:31.730
Mommy, Mommy...

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:34.630
Child, remember...

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:38.130
...since you were born to be
a child of a non-human being...

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:41.470
...you are destined to walk
on an extraordinary path.

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:45.600
But you...you are...

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:48.440
Don't worry.

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:52.580
I promise I will
raise her right.

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:54.810
I beg of you.

00:12:57.230 --> 00:12:59.570
Uh, those are sounds
of a ghastly apparition.

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:03.190
You need to leave.
Come on, leave!

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:04.840
Yes. Then...

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:08.870
It was a hasty farewell
and it was the final meeting.

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:10.630
Do you understand?

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:14.200
Ahhhh. My child's face
is fading away.

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:18.310
And the smell of milk
and its warmth...ahh.

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:21.070
What am I going to do?

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:24.820
You are not human,
but you had a child with a human.

00:13:24.890 --> 00:13:26.580
So this is your destiny.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:28.800
Cry to your
heart's content.

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:32.360
But you will not be able
to return to the human world.

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:09.860
Now the preparation is done.

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:13.330
We just need to wait
for her to wake up...

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:14.870
No.

00:14:16.170 --> 00:14:18.870
-There is still something missing.
- Madam...

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:40.130
I'll finish off your sloppy
performance for you.

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:41.860
Huh?

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:43.790
Mr. Shinma Protector.

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:46.360
The Awakening ritual
is over now.

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:48.970
The exit is that way.

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:52.650
But she is not
completely awake yet.

00:14:53.340 --> 00:14:55.100
The barrier her father
put around her...

00:14:55.180 --> 00:14:56.370
...should have been
dissolved by now.

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:59.140
I've been waiting
for this day!

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:31.010
What's wrong, Father?

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:35.740
Reiha, this is
your father now.

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:08.140
Miyu...Miyu...

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:17.050
Mother?

00:16:25.570 --> 00:16:26.660
Where are we?

00:16:26.740 --> 00:16:30.680
Miyu. Your father
was a Shinma.

00:16:31.940 --> 00:16:32.910
Shinma?

00:16:33.140 --> 00:16:34.630
I'm an ordinary human.

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:38.840
But I fell in love with your father
and you were born.

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:43.180
And you are destined
to be a Guardian.

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:45.090
Why?

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:46.650
There is no why.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:49.460
It is destiny.

00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:08.900
Miyu!

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:17.050
Father said, "Miyu."

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:20.620
He didn't call out my name.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:22.860
Why?

00:17:23.760 --> 00:17:28.020
Why did he forget about me
at the very last minute?

00:17:29.530 --> 00:17:30.760
It's Miyu's fault.

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:33.600
Stray Shinmas
are also our enemies.

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:35.460
That's right.

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:38.600
I will never forget it.

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:54.320
What happened
to my father?

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:56.750
He was killed
by Black Kite.

00:17:56.990 --> 00:17:59.080
He and his group
were after him...

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:00.990
...to make sure that a Guardian
wouldn't be born.

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:03.230
But your father...

00:18:03.300 --> 00:18:06.760
...put a barrier around you
and kept them away.

00:18:07.300 --> 00:18:09.830
My memories have
been sealed, too...

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:13.410
...so that I can hand
everything over to you.

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:14.810
Miyu...

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:18.540
...from now on, you are the one
to fight against stray Shinmas.

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:21.910
No. I don't want to.

00:18:22.850 --> 00:18:24.220
I'm sorry, Miyu.

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:27.150
I wish I could have given birth
to you as an ordinary child.

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:31.560
But I can't change destiny.

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:44.900
Mother!

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:46.730
Mother!

00:18:47.740 --> 00:18:49.900
Are you awake,
young lady?

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:56.410
No. Guardian!

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:58.910
Miyu...

00:19:01.520 --> 00:19:05.250
Succeed my blood...
and my memories...

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:09.730
Mother!

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:14.040
Mother! I don't
have to ride a train.

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:16.760
I wanted to be
with you forever.

00:19:18.810 --> 00:19:20.740
Is that so? Then...

00:19:23.610 --> 00:19:25.540
Go along
with your mother!

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:44.800
Stray Shinma!

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:46.460
Stray Shinma!

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:48.130
To the darkness!

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:49.760
To the darkness!

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:11.920
This...is my power...

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:14.520
...and my duty.

00:21:04.810 --> 00:21:05.780
Are you going?

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:09.660
There is nothing
left here for me.

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:12.420
Everything I was waiting for...

00:21:12.650 --> 00:21:16.490
...and everything that was
holding me here is all gone.

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:18.450
You've grown up.

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:19.830
No.

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:22.530
I can no longer
become an adult.

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:24.230
Miyu.

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.130
Drink my blood...

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:18.740
The door opens,
and before me is eternity

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:25.520
Whose voice calls
from so far away?

00:22:26.060 --> 00:22:31.930
Someone smoothes down my hair...
Who are you?

00:22:35.740 --> 00:22:39.540
My flute sings of a land
my heart so wishes for

00:22:39.740 --> 00:22:44.470
Where time
and my feelings pass by

00:22:44.780 --> 00:22:48.580
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:22:48.950 --> 00:22:52.750
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:22:53.760 --> 00:23:01.540
Footprints I leave behind...
washed away

00:23:05.000 --> 00:23:11.340
The night is mysterious,
it conceals the truth

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:18.000
Invited by the moon,
darkness spreads through the sky

00:23:19.980 --> 00:23:26.440
The night is violet,
tears fall like rain

00:23:26.720 --> 00:23:33.090
The sky cries for me

00:23:41.070 --> 00:23:46.530
The door opens,
and before me is eternity

00:23:47.240 --> 00:23:53.300
Whose voice calls
from so far away?

00:23:53.850 --> 00:23:59.720
Someone smoothes down my hair...
Who are you?

00:24:03.520 --> 00:24:07.360
My flute sings of a land
my heart so wishes for

00:24:07.530 --> 00:24:12.260
Where time
and my feelings pass by

00:24:12.570 --> 00:24:16.370
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:24:16.740 --> 00:24:20.540
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:24:21.540 --> 00:24:29.310
Footprints I leave behind...
washed away

00:24:32.790 --> 00:24:39.120
The night is mysterious,
it conceals the truth

00:24:39.360 --> 00:24:45.790
Invited by the moon,
darkness spreads through the sky

00:24:47.770 --> 00:24:54.230
The night is violet,
tears fall like rain

00:24:54.510 --> 00:25:00.880
The sky cries for me

00:25:06.290 --> 00:25:08.750
It snows in Tokyo
in the middle of summer.

00:25:08.960 --> 00:25:10.120
Reiha's anger...

00:25:10.190 --> 00:25:13.060
...starts to cover the city
white all over the place.

00:25:13.130 --> 00:25:16.290
We have lived the same time.

00:25:16.460 --> 00:25:17.430
But...

00:25:17.670 --> 00:25:19.700
... we have
different destinies...

00:25:19.870 --> 00:25:23.200
...and this is the only way we can
communicate with each other.

00:25:23.700 --> 00:25:26.400
The next episode of
Vampire Princess MIYU...

00:25:26.670 --> 00:25:27.900
"Confrontation. "

00:25:28.940 --> 00:25:30.140
Reiha...

00:25:30.440 --> 00:25:32.410
Someday...once again...
